						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														The Dragons Circle in Great Divide Event<br />
<br />
I am putting together an event that is for lvl30 +.<br />
The event , (not a raid), is to the Dragons Circle in Great Divide, in the Vellious Continient to get a &quot;key&quot;, (a tooth)&quot;, so you can port back and forth to the Great Divide. This key is a &quot;no drop/lore item&quot; that is located in the center of the Druid Circle. Everyne is forced to make the trip on foot their first time out, and can not port with out the key. The Great Divide is Located in the center of the Vellious continent. The Dragons Circle is not an area that had Dragons, (this is what I thought before I found out). It is simply a Druid Circle that has a small statue of a Dragon.<br />
<br />
Requirements: <br />
#1. That you are lvl 30 or more.<br />
#2. You have the Vellious Expansion.<br />
#3. You have or will have a desire to port to and from the Great Divide.<br />
<br />
The lvl 30 + requirement is not my idea. Verant has made it impossible to enter Velious at lvl 29 or under. I tried  about five times, (lol, call me stubborn), before I was lvl 30 from the small dock in North Ro. Everytime, I was ported back to a safe area by the North Ro/Freeport zone.<br />
<br />
This an a great opportunity as we can go in a group together and be totally safe as a group.<br />
The journey is a bit long but will be fun for all. We will travel with SoW and Invisibility to make this a &quot;Totally Safe&quot; journey. Plus you get to see, in person, the &quot;Huge Frozen Ice Dragon Bridge&quot; that separates the Iceclad and Eastern Wastes zones. This makes for great screen shots! Even if you have the &quot;key&quot; already, we urge others to join, but is not mandatory. The journey will begin at the dock in Noth Ro.<br />
<br />
Factions:<br />
Do Not kill anything with the word: &quot;Coldain&quot;, like &quot;A Coldain Wolf&quot; or &quot;Coldain Gards&quot; as they are the protectors of Thurgian and the area by the Thurgian/Great Divide zone. You want good faction with them so you can bind and enter the Thurgian zone, and bring a unexpected train to them for slaughtering purposes. <br />
<br />
Side Notes:<br />
The bind area is a zone at the north end of Great Divide called Thurgidan, (loc: 0,0).<br />
The entrance is hidden. You have to walk &quot;through&quot; the infamous &quot;waterfall&quot; to zone.<br />
Thurgidan has amazing detail as it is a city in a carved out ice mountain.<br />
The Druid spell &quot;Circle of Great Divide&quot; can be purchased in the &quot;Wakening Lands&quot; zone near by.<br />
When it snows in Great Divide it also brings fog making seeing extremely difficult.<br />
You will constantly hear /shouts like &quot;When is this darn snow/fog going to end 'cause I can not see.&quot;<br />
<br />
Also, for all of you that &quot;will&quot; get to lvl 30 at anytime after this event, let me know and we will arrange an escort or two for you, so you can make the trip and get your key. We do plan to go as a group to camp the Giant Fort, from time to time as they have good exp and great loot. Also there are many caves in the Great Divide great for camping as well with Bears and Giant Worm Creatures. The group lvl's can range from 30 to 50+ depending on where and what you/we hunt.<br />
<br />
Date/Time:<br />
Please give me, Faythea, or Kandu a /tell and or post a reply as to your best day/nights &amp; times you are available. Exact date/time will be posted soon.<br />
<br />
p.s. We have to have all areas possible for porting for all, as Kandu looks bored at times  :-)<br />
<br />
<br />
----Maktar (Nobel Alliance)						</td>
